{"availability":"available","full":"ax5hay/akshaybajpai.com","name":"akshaybajpai.com","description":"My personal site, issued as an architectural drawing set. Every route is a numbered sheet and the homepage is the key plan they sit on; the whole set re-issues in three CSS-only states, with an x-ray lens you can drop over any part to read what it is made of. Next.js 15, static export, zero 3D or animation runtime deps, on GitHub Pages.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-12-29T23:39:19Z","updated":"2026-10-06T13:52:11Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.akshaybajpai.com","topics":["css","design","github-pages","nextjs","personal-website","portfolio","react","static-site","typescript"],"demo":"https://www.akshaybajpai.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:39.950Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:39.950Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:39.950Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T02:09:39.950Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Every route is a numbered sheet. The homepage is the key plan they sit on.","The whole set re-issues in three states, and a lens shows what any part of it is made of.","Best viewed on desktop. The set is drawn for a wide screen: the pannable plan, the lens and the sheet transitions open up there. The phone is not that plan made small; it is a drawing of its own."],"features":["All three modes ship as static markup. No second render and no hydration flash,","The mode resolves before first paint, so a sheet never renders on paper and then","Switching repaints but never reflows. Annotations are drawn into margin the prose"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ax5hay/akshaybajpai.com/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6eb80917a8764d5c07dd0a42a29016c9dc502ab803da7cd394cd85fb5b55544d","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.272Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:40.272Z","projectInsights":